    "title": "As a Product Builder, I Gave Claude Code an Expert Panel, a Project Manager, and a Discipline Officer",
    "summary": "AI is a multiplier, not an addend. gstack, GSD, and Superpowers work as an expert team, a project manager, and a discipline officer for AI programming.",
    "publishedAt": "2026-06-02",
