    "title": "Why Can Some AI Only Chat, While Others Can Actually Do Work for You?",
    "summary": "Using calendars, meeting notes, and email as examples, this piece explains the difference between chatbots, workflows, and Agents: the key is not how many tools exist, but who decides the next step.",
    "publishedAt": "2026-05-31",
